=head2 SDL_AsyncIOTaskType

Types of asynchronous I/O tasks.

=over

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_TASK_READ = 0 - A read operation.

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_TASK_WRITE = 1 - A write operation.

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_TASK_CLOSE = 2 - A close operation.

=back

=head2 SDL_AsyncIOResult

Possible outcomes of an asynchronous I/O task.

=over

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_COMPLETE = 0 - request was completed without error

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_FAILURE = 1 - request failed for some reason; check SDL_GetError()!

=item SDL_ASYNCIO_CANCELED = 2 - request was canceled before completing.

=back



